# Pass "ads2": A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2 beside this mod, and nothing else optional.
#
# SamBucher.ADogSaidAnimalProsthetics2, Workshop 3238353862, by SamBucher, supports 1.4 to 1.6. It declares
# no dependency: its loadAfter list only orders it after the mods it has patches for, none of which is
# staged here. This pass plays 14-animal-prosthetics-2, which checks that the recipe lists the game holds
# on this mod's races carry the prosthetics of the other mod, and that this mod loads before it.
#
# The item is a Windows subscription (version 1.3.7, 1.6 folder present, checked 2026-09-24), and staging
# reads the Windows Workshop folder first, so nothing has to be downloaded into the WSL cache.
#
# ORDER. The staging does not sort by loadBefore: it activates the mods named here, in this order, and then
# the mod under test. Left alone, ADS2 loads first, copies its category lists onto its surgery recipes before
# this mod has added its races, and the first run of this pass failed for exactly that (the mod at position
# 10, ADS2 at 9). A player's mod manager sorts by loadBefore; the staging has to be told. Naming the mod's
# own packageId with a path: overlay puts it at this position and makes the staging skip its own copy of it.
nelim.ancientchinesebeastandgeneexpandedrenew   path:AncientChineseBeastAndGeneExpandedRenew/Mod
SamBucher.ADogSaidAnimalProsthetics2   3238353862
